omposition with fully locked camera. Opening time segment: <Subject 1> only shows natural blinking, subtle breathing micro‑movements and speech‑aligned lip articulation, no hand or arm gesture motions. Middle time segment: <Subject 1> performs restrained natural speaking‑related hand gestures with stable head posture, lip‑sync remains tightly aligned to vocal audio. Closing time segment: all hand‑gesture motions terminate completely, <Subject 1> reverts to only natural blinking and breathing micro‑movements without any hand‑arm gestures. Camera remains completely locked, no pan, zoom, tilt or parallax shift from start to finish. Retain original garment base colors, fabric details and unchanged background environment. Keep the entire shot free of added subtitles, captions, lyric text, titles, labels, watermarks and graphic overlays.\noverall_soundscape:\nThe supplied audio reference guides visible speaking lip‑sync performance; no additional diegetic sounds are specified.\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 36, "type": "Text _O", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text _O"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [106], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [107], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [270, 126], "pos": [744.6673583984375, 6346.509765625], "widgets_values": ["9:16 (Portrait Widescreen)", 0.4, 32], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "preview", "label": "preview", "type": "RESOLUTION_PREVIEW", "localized_name": "preview"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels